d-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/743149-purging-a-vampire-of-wyrm-taint?p=752743#post752743\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> A rather messed up reading of arachnid biology meant to introduce gimmicky traits resembling those from another game, really, but the result is the same end point.</div> </div> </div> </div>I think it was more from a mechanical stand point since spiders eat the liquefied insides of their prey it's easier to say &quot;spend a blood point&quot; rather then &quot;spend a goo point&quot; or how many &quot;goo&quot; traits do I get from the average adult human","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3953-dwight","name":"Dwight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3953_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2355"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-04T05:54:48-08:00","id":753803,"title":"","content":"I'm so using &quot;Goo Points&quot; in my next game <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8760-cogliostro","name":"Cogliostro","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8760_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"505"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-04T10:03:36-08:00","id":754343,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dwight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/743149-purging-a-vampire-of-wyrm-taint?p=753789#post753789\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think it was more from a mechanical stand point since spiders eat the liquefied insides of their prey it's easier to say &quot;spend a blood point&quot; rather then &quot;spend a goo point&quot; or how many &quot;goo&quot; traits do I get from the average adult human</div> </div> </div> </div>Chyme Points FTW! It's still not technically the exactly correct word, but it's way closer, since there's a lot more than just blood to consume.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-04T11:36:51-08:00","id":754603,"title":"","content":"I think that blood is way sexier to sell then external digestion, liquefication and sucking of the resultant slurry. I'm pretty sure they just wanted to lower the squick and try to bank some Heat from Vampires.<br /> <br /> Btw, Saur Ops, you sound well educated on matters biological, what is it that you do?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8760-cogliostro","name":"Cogliostro","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8760_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"505"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-04T12:26:20-08:00","id":754758,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Cogliostro</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/743149-purging-a-vampire-of-wyrm-taint?p=754603#post754603\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think that blood is way sexier to sell then external digestion, liquefication and sucking of the resultant slurry. I'm pretty sure they just wanted to lower the squick and try to bank some Heat from Vampires.<br /> <br /> Btw, Saur Ops, you sound well educated on matters biological, what is it that you do?</div> </div> </div> </div>Recover from being on too low a thyroid dosage, mostly. But before that I was in grad school for a masters in biology (technically the program was for costal, marine, and wetlands studies) trying to lay groundwork that would, I had hoped, lead up to doctoral studies, being a professional biologist, etc.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}